{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30876","headline":"送和北虏使 · 马戴","name":"送和北虏使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"路始阴山北，迢迢雨雪天。\n长城人过少，沙碛马难前。\n日入流沙际，阴生瀚海边。\n刀鐶向月动，旌纛冒霜悬。\n逐兽孤围合，交兵一箭传。\n穹庐移斥候，烽火绝祁连。\n汉将行持节，胡儿坐控弦。\n明妃的回面，南送使君旋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30876.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30876","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}